{"id":"erfinden","lemma":"erfinden","pos":"verb","rank":3772,"glosses":["to invent","to fabricate (something untrue); to make up (a story)","to find out, to discover"],"ipa":"/ɛʁˈfɪndən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/De-at-erfinden.ogg/De-at-erfinden.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"erfinde","1p":"erfinden","2s":"erfindest","2p":"erfindet","3s":"erfindet","3p":"erfinden"},"preterite":{"1s":"erfand","1p":"erfanden","2s":"erfandest","2p":"erfandet","3s":"erfand","3p":"erfanden"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe erfunden","1p":"haben erfunden","2s":"hast erfunden","2p":"habt erfunden","3s":"hat erfunden","3p":"haben erfunden"},"future":{"1s":"werde erfinden","1p":"werden erfinden","2s":"wirst erfinden","2p":"werdet erfinden","3s":"wird erfinden","3p":"werden erfinden"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"erfind","2p":"erfindet"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde erfinden","1p":"würden erfinden","2s":"würdest erfinden","2p":"würdet erfinden","3s":"würde erfinden","3p":"würden erfinden"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"erfunden"},"formAudio":{"erfunden":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/20/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-erfunden.wav","erfand":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8a/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Natschoba-erfand.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Bell erfand das Telefon.","en":"Bell invented the telephone.","words":[{"g":"like a canine","l":"bellen"},null,{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"telephone"}]},{"text":"Ich erfinde gerne Nützliches.","en":"I like to invent useful things.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"don't mention it"},{"g":"useful","l":"nützlich"}]},{"text":"Du musst das Rad nicht neu erfinden.","en":"You don't need to reinvent the wheel.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"wheel"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"new"},null]},{"text":"Wenn es Gott nicht gäbe, dann müsste man ihn erfinden.","en":"If God did not exist, it would be necessary to invent him.","words":[{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"god"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"then, after that"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"him"},null]},{"text":"Es ist nicht bekannt, wer zuerst das Rad erfand.","en":"It's not known who first invented the wheel.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"known, familiar"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"first, firstly"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"wheel"},null]}]}